{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>10月15日晚間，針對網絡反映的「尊界V800汽車剎車踏板支架斷裂問題」，工信部等三部門成立聯合調查組開展核查，並依法依規處理。</p>\n<p>隨後，尊界汽車發佈聲明回應稱，「工信部等三部門發佈了聯合調查有關車輛剎車踏板支架斷裂問題的通報。我們積極響應、完全服從並將全力配合聯合調查組的工作，堅決維護消費者合法權益，堅決維護新能源汽車產業發展大局。」</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/db15cc590d543e9f9de1f9e12bc1f2b30b346addc2ff4fd1a6672956752ad8ad/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w640%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fnewtalk.tw%2Fc7736a7a2c7b7c483c6330ca5bcc7549.jpg\">\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/db15cc590d543e9f9de1f9e12bc1f2b30b346addc2ff4fd1a6672956752ad8ad/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w640%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fnewtalk.tw%2Fc7736a7a2c7b7c483c6330ca5bcc7549.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T11:39:58.874720+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":2,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T11:36:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T17:17:56.414422+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T11:37:41.278463+00:00","content_hash":"dbd256d920e6dc0454e1b17031694e0f1b42f9356f8454bf343b6ff27fa777a1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}